Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The eternal river that\Nnever stops flowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It reminds me of cigarette smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This kid's crazy if he thinks I'll\Ntoss this much cigarette away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.12,0:00:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold your horses for\Ntwo minutes, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, relax, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe now, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can thank me with a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.78,0:01:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.32,0:02:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,wasn't there an urban legend that\Nbeast folk meat was used in hamburgers?
