Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you not talk about disgusting\Nstuff while we're eating our food?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what is that? What's wrong? A finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.28,0:03:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Big sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.90,0:03:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.07,0:03:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell told her that it\Nwas okay to smoke in the kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, thanks for helping me out\Nwith all of this, Yannineko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My porno manga and Yani\Nmagazine deadlines overlapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.18,0:03:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to die.
