Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:03:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistants these days aren't usually\Nokay with cigarettes, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I draw my art by hand, so I need\Nmy assistant in the room with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and they hate it when I smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, you're\Npretty easy to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm naturally a shy person, but I feel\Ntotally comfortable sitting here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to sound rude, but I'm kind of\Nglad you got fired from your last job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you're paid\Nwell for all of this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.18,0:04:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice. Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing great so far, Yanni Neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
