Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:04:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She's cute
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise you won't bring my\Nlittle sister into any of this?
