Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chain-smoker cat
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.78,0:14:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Friday? Wait, wrong place. Is this\Nthe neon magazine office here from the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitosubashi family Sunday\Ngroup bring out your
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:15:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,editor-in-chief Kazushi\Nwhy are you so loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the editor-in-chief, Kazushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you little punks want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.03,0:15:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Our boss got a rude\Nemail from you, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us a guest chapter,\Nunless you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.26,0:15:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No one disrespects our boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.40,0:15:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lights out, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.08,0:15:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have been happy with\NKumita, but you just had to push it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't he drop dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Copy of After Neon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,People joke they're so thick they could\Nbe used as a weapon, but it's bulletproof?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Sheet the award booklets inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That only increased the thickness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.50,0:15:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Land of the Lustrous II, that's born!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So the old bastard's an old pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.56,0:16:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is afternoon, I thought it said nyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I am getting old after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You boys done embarrassing yourselves yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Does stuff like this always happen here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,About once a year, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Call an ambulance! Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.26,0:16:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears one stray bullet\Nwent through his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You should prepare yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If only the afternoon beach manga project\Nhad been approved before this happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss really cared about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.26,0:17:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He always thought of you as family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.50,0:17:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you hold his hand? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.28,0:17:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's breathing on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, vitals are stabilizing,\Nhis pulse is normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.68,0:17:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this happening? I'm high!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's helping. He can be in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.02,0:17:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,First one here. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Naked and ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Hame!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.31,0:18:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can everyone hear and see me okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can let me know with your reactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Hame. Hi, Hame. Cute as\Nusual. Hi, Hame. We can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Hame. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that means we can get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.16,0:18:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,For today's stream, I'm going to\Nintroduce you to my neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All the girls in my building are super\Npretty, so you're in for a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.10,0:18:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, I just found the first one. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.06,0:18:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you streaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.94,0:18:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kansai, one of\Nthe funniest girls I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm not even wearing\Nany makeup right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, say something funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.40,0:18:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you go put me on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, time for the morning funnies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What but because it's not morning\Nanymore, it's afternoon. Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:19:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and that was Kansai let's find\Nthe next person hang on you got it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.74,0:19:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,all wrong I swear I'm funny You\Ncan't just throw a gal in the deep
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,end and expect her to swim ask your\Nsubscribers if they got it! Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Hame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no! Aro's an adult!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She just looks young!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.52,0:19:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't report me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Last one in drinks two bottles!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.38,0:19:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're spilling all over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it in my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to waste\Nit, so I'll drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey girl, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.42,0:19:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't show this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you streaming me\Nwithout my permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:19:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess she's on and of her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:19:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.04,0:20:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a hookah, it's not drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on guys, I said don't report me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.78,0:20:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just joking about\Nthe whole drug thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you guys seriously not\Nknow what a hookah is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was set a warning for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.34,0:20:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing about this is even illegal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get my whole channel banned!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She kicked me out, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.14,0:20:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on to the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Hame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You came at the perfect time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a model\Nfor my new porno manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.36,0:20:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about a boy the main\Ncharacter grew up with Who
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,actually turned out to be\Na girl who's a ton of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.78,0:20:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'm streaming right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.40,0:20:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you let go of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I'll do anything you want in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you as strong as a beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, next person!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now we have the\Nbuilding's final boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.40,0:20:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as dirty as always, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know there's mold everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:20:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't pay me to sleep there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Quarantine the whole building.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can smell it through my screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.04,0:21:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The door's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.16,0:21:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if she's on the balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.20,0:21:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Yani, what are you up to? Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm eating bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted a new flavor in\Nmy mouth other than smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.84,0:21:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is actually great content.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who's normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about it, and there's one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys, this room belongs to the most\Nimportant person in the building, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.80,0:21:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he'll come out\Nif I tell him I'm streaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.70,0:21:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I just secretly film him instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.90,0:22:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.32,0:22:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.30,0:23:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.14,0:23:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.46,0:23:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold. It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.21,0:23:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.28,0:23:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.68,0:23:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.76,0:23:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind is going to come.
